* NMOS Transistor
M1 D G S S NMOS

* Capacitors
Cgs G S Cgs_value
Cgd D G Cgd_value
CL D 0 CL_value

* Resistors
Rsig 3 5 Rsig_value
RL D 4 RL_value

* Voltage Source
Vsig 3 5 DC Vsig_value

* Nodes
* 1 -> Ground
* 2 -> G
* 3 -> Between Vsig and Rsig
* 4 -> D
* 5 -> Ground
* 6 -> S

* Definitions (Replace with actual values)
.model NMOS NMOS
Cgs_value = xxx
Cgd_value = xxx
CL_value = xxx
Rsig_value = xxx
RL_value = xxx
Vsig_value = xxx